## Pretrained Models

Multiple trained models are available in the `models/` directory:
- `sac_gnn_1.pth` through `sac_gnn_34.pth` â€” Models trained on various configurations
- `sac_gnn_dim256.pth` â€” Variant with larger hidden dimension (256)

Load any model via:
```python
CONFIG['model_path'] = 'models/sac_gnn_29.pth'
```

